# Never commit real secrets. MCP configs with tokens live in the *consuming*
# project, not here — but guard against accidental drops of a filled-in template.
# Plugin-root .mcp.json files are the exception: they are part of the shipped
# plugins and must be secret-free by design.
.mcp.json
!plugins/*/.mcp.json
*.local.json
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

# Key material — nothing of this kind belongs in a config catalog
*.pem
*.key
id_rsa*
credentials.json

# OS / editor cruft
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
